Your next step

Match the tool to your goal. If you want to get bigger and stronger, make lifting the centerpiece and use rucking for conditioning. If you want durability and work capacity, rucking can do a lot of that on its own, with hills and a little weight added over time. Add some resistance training if keeping muscle is a priority. New to loaded walking? Start with the complete beginner's guide to rucking and the ruck weight guide.

